; --- Refraction reference card ---------------------------------------
; A checker behind the glass cube: the UE substrate-48 read for refractive
; bend and for Beer-Lambert path length. The cells are straight and evenly
; spaced, so any displacement or magnification seen THROUGH the cube is the
; refraction, judged against the same cells visible around its silhouette.
; Built from tiles rather than a texture so it has no asset dependency.

